阻力不计, 求:\n(1)线框下边刚离开磁场时做匀速运动的速度大小；\n(2)线框从静止释放到线框上边匀速离开磁场所需要的时间；\n(3)经足够长时间后，小球能到达的最低点与电场上边界的距离；\n(4)整个运动过程中线框内产生的总热量.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b06fd8f47c459057b2674dc7e7f43e7f60bea7739620397b4fb4c817114c16ae.png","width":512,"height":484,"width_mm":60.032,"row_group":"xuejun-zhongxue-2512-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n\n原卷公共参数：无特殊说明，"},{"type":"math","value":"g=10\\,\\mathrm{m/s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17(1)1m/s; (2) t = 0.5s; (3)0.133m; (4) Q = 0.4J"},{"type":"text","value":"【详解】(1)设线框下边离开磁场时做匀速直线运动的速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则有："},{"type":"math","value":"E = BLv_{0}"},{"type":"math","value":"I = \\frac{E}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{A} = BIL"},{"type":"text","value":"以上三式任一一式给1分"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{A} = \\frac{B^{2}L^{2}v_{0}}{R} = (M + m)g"},{"type":"text","value":"1分"},{"type":"text","value":"可解得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0} = \\frac{(M + m)Rg}{B^{2}L^{2}} = 1\\mathrm{m / s}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分"},{"type":"text","value":"(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"(M + m)gt - B\\bar{I}Lt = (M + m)v_0"},{"type":"text","value":"1分"},{"type":"text","value":"其中："},{"type":"math","value":"q = \\overline{I} t = \\frac{2BL^2}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分"},{"type":"text","value":"由以上两式代入数据解得："},{"type":"math","value":"t=0.5\\,\\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"(3)从线框刚离开磁场区域到小球刚运动到电场的下边界的过程中，由动能定理得："},{"type":"math","value":"-qEL + (M + m)g(1.5L) = 0 - \\frac{1}{2} (M + m)v_0^2"},{"type":"text","value":"1分"},{"type":"text","value":"解得："},{"type":"math","value":"E = 7\\times 10^{3}\\mathrm{N / C}"},{"type":"text","value":"（或Eq=1.75N，其它方法结果对也给分） 1分"},{"type":"text","value":"设经足够长时间后，线框最终不会再进入磁场，即运动的最高点是线框的上边与磁场的下边界重合，小球做上下往复运动."},{"type":"text","value":"设小球运动的最低点到电场上边界的距离为"},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":"，从图中“1”位置到“2”位置："},{"typ